      "writtenOn": "2022-05-09T13:35:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This surprised me too. Apparently, when you create a module using CreateModule instead of adding to a .bp file, the module type gets a suffix of \"_\" + \u003csome stuff\u003e added to it. Where \u003csome stuff\u003e itself starts with an \"_\" which is where you get the \"__\" from.\n\nI think it only affects one or maybe two modules in art so isn\u0027t a big deal.",
      "parentUuid": "038fcbd2_c50e9dd3",
